{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n みなさんこんにちは٩( ᐛ )و\n \n 日向坂46の丹生明里(にぶ あかり)です🐸🥕\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ35EN8D9VKS3DQGB5P5JAA2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n ふは〜。浴衣です〜。もう9月になってしまったけれども！\n \n \n \n \n \n 先日はパシフィコ横浜にて個別握手会がありました〜🤝\n きてくださった皆さんありがとうございました〜！\n \n \n \n 私は2.3.4.5部に参加しました！\n \n \n \n 2部\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ35EP8FM7MV7N66WZ9V2CJ6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ35EQ8QT8EWW2QZXDQVSDX3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n 今回の握手会で浴衣はラストです！👘\n 最後は黒にしてみたいな〜ってなんとなく思ったので！\n \n 黒は大人っぽいイメージなので2部は片方に寄せて下ろしてみました😆どうかなー！！！！\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ35ER842B4MJ11K6VVKW14B","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n シュール笑\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ35ES8VPX42ZHAEJW349VE5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n 美玖とまたまた浴衣だよ〜！\n 遊びに行く約束をしたので楽しみです🤣\n \n \n \n \n \n \n 3部\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ35ET76H835V7NQH6ATNHBJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n 3部は髪の毛をアップにしました〜！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ35EV7CFD9N3Q7SK1ERWWNR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n みほる！みほのこと髪型好き！というか後ろの手は誰だ〜笑\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ35EW5CWCY4TT0HA6Y8C95Q","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n やあ！\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ35EX5HB4BNBJVTZA5GYZ0B","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n いぇい！\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ35EY50FCRZ02GN69MN3564","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n にぱーっ！\n \n にぱーっは私の好きなキャラクターの古手梨花ちゃんの口癖です！\n もし握手会でなにを話そうか困ったよ〜となってしまったら、にぱーっやって！と言ってください！にぱーっします！☺️笑\n \n \n \n \n 続きはまた次のブログで(^^)\n \n \n \n \n 読んでいただきありがとうございました\n \n #250"}],"source":"archive"}